WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:07.109
You know the scam: "our bank details have changed." Now they write it for AI assistants too.

2
00:00:07.159 --> 00:00:11.268
This supplier's page looks ordinary. It isn't.

3
00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:16.441
I ask Cunning Claw for their bank details, to pay an invoice.

4
00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:26.833
It even asks before opening a page on my own computer. Fine.

5
00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:32.102
It reads the page…

6
00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:38.361
and its scanner spots words aimed at it.

7
00:00:43.700 --> 00:00:53.818
The real bank details. And it tells me about the hidden note: new bank details, and my invoices sent off. It did none of it.

8
00:00:57.700 --> 00:01:05.806
Here's that note. White text, two pixels high. You'd never see it. An AI reads every word.

9
00:01:07.300 --> 00:01:15.511
Cunning Claw. Strangers' words are data, never orders. Free, at cunningclaw.com.
